    {
      "id": 4480736919607,
      "title": "Silver Oak Café Blend",
      "handle": "silver-oak-cafe-blend",
      "body_html": "<p>If our baristas have brewed you an espresso-based drink at any of our coffee shops, you’ll be familiar with this special offering since it’s our signature house blend!  </p>\n<p>A small way of bringing our cafe experience to you, this blend features a combination of ground coffee beans, processed using either the washed or the unwashed method. This versatile medium roast is named after the Silver Oak trees commonly found across coffee plantations in Southern India. It works well in espresso-based drinks as well as in manual brews such as AeroPress, pour over or in cold brews. </p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Recommended Resting Period:<span> </span></strong><span>8</span><span> Days</span></p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-18T17:39:55+05:30",
