    {
      "id": 456367752,
      "title": "French Roast",
      "handle": "french-roast",
      "body_html": "<p>Our darkest roasted coffee, the French Roast is a blend best enjoyed black for those who like their coffee bold, like a traditional espresso with bittersweet notes. If you’re looking to add milk and still retain a definite bite, this is a great choice. </p>\n<p>We recommend brewing this as an Espresso or using manual brewing equipment such as French Press or Moka Pot.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Recommended Resting Period:<span> </span></strong><span>5</span><span> Days</span></p>",
